{
  "id": "E239",
  "title": "Help Print a Contract",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-07-25",
  "synopsis": "Tianzhong needs some help printing a contract at the office.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/797/9bf5f9f52f9687606a6a95c12b1ccd4b03f21560.mp3?1531654044",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "帮打印合同\n\n田中：圆圆，我的电脑坏了。你能帮我打印一下这份合同吗？\n圆圆：好的，没问题。你要打印几份？单面还是双面？\n田中：双面的，打印三份。\n圆圆：好的。\n田中：太谢谢你了。\n圆圆：不客气。",
    "traditional": "幫打印合同\n\n田中：圓圓，我的電腦壞了。你能幫我打印一下這份合同嗎？\n圓圓：好的，沒問題。你要打印幾份？單面還是雙面？\n田中：雙面的，打印三份。\n圓圓：好的。\n田中：太謝謝你了。\n圓圓：不客氣。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Help Print a Contract"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "田中：圆圆，我的电脑坏了。你能帮我打印一下这份合同吗？",
      "traditional": "田中：圓圓，我的電腦壞了。你能幫我打印一下這份合同嗎？",
      "pinyin": "tián zhōng yuán yuán wǒ de diàn nǎo huài le nǐ néng bāng wǒ dǎ yìn yí xià zhè fèn hé tong ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Tianzhong: Yuanyuan, my computer broke down. Could you help me print this contract?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "圆圆：好的，没问题。你要打印几份？单面还是双面？",
      "traditional": "圓圓：好的，沒問題。你要打印幾份？單面還是雙面？",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán hǎo de méi wèn tí nǐ yào dǎ yìn jǐ fèn dān miàn hái shi shuāng miàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Sure, no problem. How many copies do you want to print? One-sided or two-sided?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "田中：双面的，打印三份。",
      "traditional": "田中：雙面的，打印三份。",
      "pinyin": "tián zhōng shuāng miàn de dǎ yìn sān fèn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Tianzhong: Two-sided, three copies."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "圆圆：好的。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：好的。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "田中：太谢谢你了。",
      "traditional": "田中：太謝謝你了。",
      "pinyin": "tián zhōng tài xiè xie nǐ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Tianzhong: Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "圆圆：不客气。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：不客氣。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán bú kè qi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: You’re welcome."
    }
  ],
